305366508183245_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ucRekX7TtzwQ7kNvwGi292G&_nc_oc=Adpwb-GhlKcX1njYHEI5DVSq9gpfFeOZqeUpA1mnXriy3otuy87hyNBEJKF9i5OmPWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7T8zJMZc_1MwlvV21i4eRzuH_tG4m7fNbaXyfyJ2Ot4w&oe=6A086CDB"}, "display_name": "Alterland", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Alterland is a next-generation collaboration platform built on **Unreal Engine** to deliver **photorealistic environments, realistic avatars, and seamless multi-user interaction.** It\u2019s built for organizations that need more than just a virtual meeting room.\nWith **PC and standalone headset access,** Alterland is perfect for **workshops, onboarding, training, and education**\u2014all enhanced with **AI-powered tools** that simplify tasks and boost engagement.\n\n**Selfie-based realistic avatars** \u2013 feel truly present with your team or students.\n**3-level access system** \u2013 from personal desks to team rooms to full campuses.\n**Built-in collaboration tools** \u2013 whiteboards, sticky notes, 3D markers, polls, and AI Smart Notes.\n**Optimized for scale** \u2013 from small team meetings to large events or conferences.\n\nWhether you\u2019re hosting a class, running a workshop, or connecting a global team, **Alterland makes remote collaboration feel effortless and real.**", "short_description": "Alterland \u2013 Next-Level VR Collaboration\n\nUltra-realistic spaces and powerful AI tools. Designed for teams, educators, and event hosts who want VR collaboration to feel natural, productive, and scalable."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alterland.io/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.alterland.io/Terms_and_Conditions_Clean_15.09.2024.pdf", "publisher_name": "Alterland", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.alterland.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_cat